; EDF thrust curve - Hobbyocean 90 mm 12-blade 6S EDF (thrust PROXY table 30.30 N @ 22.2 V, params edf.thrust_source)
; model: sim/edf.py T = T_max u^2 with a 0.15 s first-order lag; u ramps 0 -> 1 in 0.5 s (mission.throttle_ramp_s)
; t = 0 at the LAUNCH command executed on board; CUT executed at t = 13.064 s (6-DOF S2_nowind, the ground-assist predictive CUT incl. its retransmitted CUT frame), then exponential decay (tau 0.15 s)
; E (SENSITIVITY): T_eff = T - mdot V_z with mdot = sqrt(rho A_e T) (static momentum-drag estimate, V_z from the 6-DOF S2_nowind) - not in the project model; fan-curve data would replace it
; E: total impulse 328.5 N s (vs 386.0)
; ELECTRIC: no propellant. Propellant / total mass are set to 0.1 g / 0.2 g (numerically negligible) so the
; vehicle mass stays constant; the EDF (369 g) and battery (349 g) belong to the airframe mass/CG override.
